#   b01c06s02    -0.5 (cl06a)       HELD                       +1.0 (cl06a)
#   b01c06s03    -0.5 (cl06a)       HELD                       HELD
#   ──────────   ───────────────    ───────────────────────    ──────────
#   CHAPTER Σ   -1.0               +1.0                       +1.0
#   TARGET       -1.0               +1.0                       +1.0
