#     position-prot-rise:      no patron-tier formalization event in any scene
#     relational_anchor_status: Wren contact deepens tether (social_tether-prot-rise) but does
#                                not yet add operational weight to the anchor; anchor holds at 2
#     moral_legibility_to_self: recording is honest but does not crack deeper than chapter requires;
#                                recognition runs clean and is filed; legibility holds
