#              spoken answer rather than a coverage-maintenance non-act
#   b01c06s02  Directed reading vs. the prohibition's directed-exception     climax
#              line — the feed is pointed at a named person for the first time
#   b01c06s03  Good outcome vs. the ledger that records what a good outcome  falling
#              cost the prohibition — the exception is authored, not merely done
